{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שַׁחַר אֲבַקֶּשְׁךָ. צוּרִי וּמִשְׂגַּבִּי. אֶעְרוֹךְ לְפָנֶיךָ. שַׁחְרִי וְגַם־עַרְבִּי: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לִפְנֵי גְדֻלָּתְךָ. אֶעְמֹד וְאֶבָּהֵל. כִּי־עֵינְךָ תִרְאֶה. כָּל־מַחְשְׁבוֹת לִבִּי: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מַה־זֶּה אֲשֶׁר יוּכַל. הַלֵּב וְהַלָּשׁוֹן לַעֲשׂוֹת, וּמַה־כֹּחִי. רוּחִי בְּתוֹךְ קִרְבִּי: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הִנֵּה לְךָ תִיטַב. זִמְרַת אֱנוֹשׁ, עַל־כֵּן אוֹדְךָ בְּעוֹד תִּהְיֶה. נִשְׁמַת אֱלוֹהַּ בִּי: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
